## Problem

The current repository limits declarations to 20 before the service sees them. Neither an exact all-history overview nor complete client-side history filtering can be derived from that window. The existing service/repository/DTO boundaries, funding occurrence multiplicity, decimal strings and native navigation should survive; the window should not.

## Shape

